## SUCCESS CRITERIA

A presenter must be able to open EigenH AI Native EHR, select the Scheduled Patient Journey and click Play.

Without manually typing patient details or navigating between roles, the demo should visibly show:

Scheduling → Pre-Visit Information → AI Preparation → Front Desk → Medical Assistant → Clinician Pre-Consultation → Ambient Scribe → Post-Consultation Review → Approved Actions → Lab Results → Follow-Up → Completed Patient Timeline.

The presenter must also be able to select a particular role and replay only that role's workflow.

