The same patient and encounter must remain consistent throughout.

The resulting experience should make three things immediately obvious:

1. How an AI Native EHR reduces repetitive clinical and administrative work.
2. How healthcare staff collaborate through clear role-based handoffs.
3. How AI provides useful assistance while human professionals retain control over clinical decisions.

Build a clinically credible, visually refined, genuinely interactive demonstration that clearly differentiates EigenH from a traditional form-heavy EHR.

Implement safely inside the existing application. Preserve all working functionality and prioritize a complete, reliable demonstration over the number of features created.

